# File: tests/blender/test_contract_validate.py
# Generated from: specs/134-honour-nmg-budgets-json-desktop-overrides-in-contract-validation/requirements.md
Feature: Contract validation honours nmg-budgets.json Desktop overrides

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: A Desktop triangle override lets a larger Desktop variant pass
    Given an nmg-budgets.json with {"hero_prop": {"tris": 40000, "desktop": {"tris": 300000}}}
    And a hero_prop Desktop variant with 50000 triangles
    When validate_asset runs with that budgets_path as the finalize validate step and as the export pre-check
    Then no budget.tris finding is reported for the Desktop variant

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: A Desktop triangle override still enforces its own limit
    Given the same nmg-budgets.json
    And a hero_prop Desktop variant with more than 300000 triangles
    When validate_asset runs with that budgets_path
    Then a budget.tris finding is reported for the Desktop variant
    And its message cites the 300000 budget

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: Desktop texture size and material overrides are used by the full contract
    Given an nmg-budgets.json whose standard_prop desktop object sets max_texture_px or materials
    When the full contract validates the Desktop variant against it
    Then the Desktop budget.texture_size and budget.materials checks cite the overridden values

  @SCN004 @regression
  Scenario: Mobile overrides and contract defaults behave as before
    Given an nmg-budgets.json with only top-level Mobile metrics, or no budgets_path
    When validate_asset runs
    Then the Desktop variant is checked against the contract section 6 Desktop defaults
    And the Mobile variant is checked against the top-level overrides

  @SCN005 @regression
  Scenario: An invalid Desktop override fails with the existing error
    Given an nmg-budgets.json whose desktop object has an unknown metric or a non-positive value
    When validate_asset runs with that budgets_path
    Then it raises the variants.budget_override_invalid contract error with its message and remediation
